            "block_content": "(5) Grievances not settled by the Local may be transferred to the National and, if accepted, the National shall so notify the Company. If the National intends to change the demand or present the grievance on a basis different from the previous presentation, the National shall notify the Company of such change within ten (10) days from the time when such transfer has been so accepted.",
