        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Employees reclassified to a salary-rated non-supervisory occupation, Laid-Off, suspended for disciplinary reasons, or dismissed, provided the grievance is presented to the Company by the Local within thirty (30) days after the Employee is reclassified or separated from the payroll, except that where the justification of the action is involved in disciplinary suspension, or dismissal cases, the provisions of Article 22, Disciplinary Suspension, or Termination of Employment, will apply.",
